# Normalize line endings, for the same reason the Loom does: this tree is edited on Windows and
# built under WSL, and a CRLF working tree makes shell scripts fail under WSL bash. `text=auto`
# lets git treat files as text and normalize on commit; `eol=lf` forces LF on checkout whatever
# a user's core.autocrlf says.
* text=auto eol=lf
